meta {
  name: Pricing
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  Plan and pricing manager. Reading needs `pricing.view` (every role). Editing plans, packs'
  display and ordering needs `pricing.manage`; anything that changes what customers pay or
  creates Stripe objects (prices, packs, intervals, coupons) needs `pricing.prices` (owner,
  finance). Sensitive requests need a reason and a fresh code, are rate limited, and are safe
  to retry with an `Idempotency-Key` header.

  Prices are immutable in Stripe: a new amount makes a new Stripe price, the old one is
  archived and kept in `plan_price_history`, and existing subscribers keep paying the old
  amount.
}
